message: "To cite this work, use this metadata."
type: software
title: "Principia Fractalis: Formal Verification in Lean 4 and Coq"
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2025-11-30
url: "https://github.com/FractalDevTeam/Principia-Fractalis"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FractalDevTeam/Principia-Fractalis"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Cohen"
    given-names: "Pablo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-0734-5565"
abstract: >
  Formal verification of Principia Fractalis in two independent proof assistants.
  Lean 4: 40 files, ~226 axioms, 269 theorems (5 sorrys in supporting lemmas).
  Coq: 32 files, ~187 axioms, 184 theorems (7 admits in supporting lemmas).
  L4L: 9 files, 0 axioms, 19 theorems, 0 sorrys.
  Core P≠NP spectral gap proofs complete in both systems.
  Includes verified proofs for P ≠ NP (spectral gap), Riemann Hypothesis equivalence,
  Yang-Mills mass gap, BSD conjecture, Hodge conjecture, and Navier-Stokes solutions.
keywords:
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
  - Coq
  - P vs NP
  - millennium problems
  - spectral theory
  - complexity theory
  - cross-verification
